{"assertionId":"ddb998b2-cdd4-44f2-9c0c-65c1b1324387","entityBindings":[],"fragments":[{"exactText":"TruAge™  is a medical-grade epigenetic age test — analyzing 1,000,000+ DNA methylation sites from a simple at-home test, developed with science from Harvard, Yale, and Duke. Discover your biological age, your aging speed, and the age of 11 organ systems.","fragmentId":"sha256:e1c1e7894c26bea07c6fc8bfdb23e297bad8e41657aaa28f69830cbe15f37fc7"}],"proposition":"TruAge™  is a medical-grade epigenetic age test — analyzing 1,000,000+ DNA methylation sites from a simple at-home test, developed with science from Harvard, Yale, and Duke. Discover your biological age, your aging speed, and the age of 11 organ systems.","qualifiers":[],"rubricVersion":"evidence-only.v1"}